    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1457">

                <pb facs="1110" n="994" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg994"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/156.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General Hanna to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General.</hi>
                            <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monterey</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Villa has placed million Mexican dollars fine on Chamber of Commerce.
                    Applies to foreigners in Mexico. I shall oppose forcing Americans and other
                    foreigners paying such fine or forced contributions. Please instruct me as it
                    will help case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
